    "pointer": "/classes/rogue/6/levels/17/0/d",
    "source": "When you use Wails from the Grave, you can deal its necrotic damage to the first creature as well as the second, and at the end of a long rest a soul trinket appears in your hand if you have none.",
    "sourceHash": "9f9cc868079df4b6db36da6435bbe35b3a8a1a7b155739fdb6dde2c74e9d1dd8"
  },
